{"step_index":128,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T18:35:30Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Tool Availability**\n\nI'm currently focused on evaluating available tools, specifically their applicability to various tasks. I'm considering the spectrum from specialized tools like `view_file` to more general ones that provide terminal command execution. I am considering these tools and the contexts they are relevant in, ensuring I understand their function.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Task list for the Summarist v2 project, covering Next.js setup, state management, components, pages, payments, authentication, and manual testing.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Tasks - Summarist v2\n\n- [ ] Project Initialization\n  - [ ] Initialize Next.js project with Tailwind CSS, App Router, TypeScript, ESLint in `./`\n  - [ ] Install required packages (`@reduxjs/toolkit`, `react-redux`, `react-icons`, `canvas-confetti`)\n- [ ] Asset Recovery\n  - [ ] Download logos and landing illustrations from original repository assets\n  - [ ] Put them in public directory\n- [ ] Redux & Mock Layer Setup\n  - [ ] Create mock database endpoints & utility functions (Auth state, Library storage, Stripe state)\n  - [ ] Configure Redux Store and slices (auth, player, library)\n- [ ] Core Layout and Navigation\n  - [ ] Build global Layout with Sidebar and Top Search Bar (excluding home and sales pages)\n  - [ ] Implement debounced search utility (300ms) with API endpoint calls\n  - [ ] Implement global Auth Modal (Login, Register, Guest Login) linked to Redux Auth state\n- [ ] Page Implementation\n  - [ ] Home Page (`/`) - Landing page with layout matched to original repo but with Tailwind styling\n  - [ ] Dashboard Page (`/for-you`) - Selected Book banner, Recommended / Suggested carousels with skeleton loadings\n  - [ ] Inside Book Page (`/book/[id]`) - Dynamic route showing book descriptions and logic to handle premium redirects\n  - [ ] Audio Player Page (`/player/[id]`) - Summary description, progress bar slider, speeds, rewinds, and end-of-audio handler\n  - [ ] Sales Page (`/choose-plan`) - Yearly/Monthly tier selections, FAQ accordion\n  - [ ] Settings Page (`/settings`) - Profile details, billing details, mock payment upgrade triggers\n  - [ ] Library Page (`/library`) - Saved book cards list, finished book cards list\n- [ ] Verification and Polish\n  - [ ] Verify production compilation (`npm run build`)\n  - [ ] Verify responsiveness on Mobile and Desktop\n","Description":"Created the task.md file to track project progress.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\ambat\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\c7e5dbbf-c810-4443-81c8-ce6c4ef145fb\\task.md","toolAction":"Creating task list artifact","toolSummary":"Write to file"}}]}
